<description>&lt;p&gt;A bomb exploded near a Colombian military base killing four civilians, including a two-month-old infant, and a drone attack killed two soldiers in the Choco department. President De la Espriella has renewed a military offensive against dissidents and ordered additional bombings and aerial spraying following the Planadas bombing. The UN has renewed its mission in Colombia but excluded rural reform, while the government launched a broader offensive after seven attacks in six days. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPNGltcUZYZVlFVVlVUE95SHJOWmVodnVOOERSOUMtQi0yUVIxSS1CcFRrMVA2cE5xQXJkOS13WFVPRzhDRFFhMGgyaXdSZFhZV25pUGQtaXk2eUtnMjBjSDBxcUJ0QUFtT2dOZEluM0IzYTlWUWV6WHVteWVWamVMZGtYbUlIeGJMTVdQM2h4TmZlZmtrQjJpZUMzYmVBUkI0ZmhiR0M0TkpWcXU1NDk3RV9adkFwd3FRSTRvZW54UnQxdmMt?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5fWW05WWFRdXd6bFJjVU5RMko0dHdmalg4RWJQeF9HRnRyd1VPS2VrWWF0T0haQ2l2WGppRU5EVE1xZU1PbE1VeFVMWFVVdmhJMXVhQVlvdFV6OHpv?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxOY09JM2NIVXRJbHVIN2EycHZKUW9yNDRDbjJLSTlLNXN4YmxLSWNUQWFCcEJsR1VwaS11RUpsVDl1aHYwOVFsd0R0dWtvazVqWFFkM0VmeFozSkpUS2hXRi1BYVQzMnJia2NqcWZiSDRZZThSdWVTRGdTa0tTRGpuUDdpX1pwWTNCSUVEWWVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPdjhVYk9URTlXdHJheWs5YWd5bWZLVEpJLW9rZmxDYlV6Z0haQk1oSTZ3VGFYQnd0UTU0dkZCdUZTQkVDMjZzdk1jLWhaQTA2UFRSdUNyZzYtVVFLN1p0TnpOTzM2V2xYanhhV0gyRFBhWTJMMC1Kb0Q1bGVXTmJtOHlmTmN3UmhnbzVtSg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOaFN5ZkJyNFhuSWRCTm5SLUp3NzlwWE80VDVOaWdrellTVW5IendaeHNiT